<title>POLAND: Polish KGHM domestic offer oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Polish KGHM domestic offer oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:	     KGHM Polska Miedz SA</p>
<p> Type of Issue:    existing common shares</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:		   65,000,000</p>
<p> Total Size of Domestic Offer:		 30,000,000</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Subscribed:		75,730,875</p>
<p> Institutional Price (PLN)	 21.0</p>
<p> Retail Price (PLN)		  19.0</p>
<p>TRANCHES		NO OF SHARES   NO OF SHARES    ORDERS</p>
<p>			  SUBSCRIBED     ALLOTTED	REDUCTION (PCT)</p>
<p>Domestic</p>
<p>- Large investors*  24,456,820    14,000,000	22</p>
<p>- Large investors**  8,822,692	 none	   --</p>
<p>- Retail		42,451,363    16,000,000	62</p>
<p>International	 TBA	     35,000.000	N.A.</p>
<p>NOTES: * - Investors taking part in book-building</p>
<p>** - Investors who did not participate in book-building.</p>
<p>- The treasury ministry did not allot any shares for investors who did not take part in book-building. The international issue of Global Depositary Receipts is due by August 13.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
